All,

Our bituminous coating that is standard on our DI fittings has an NSF 61 li=
sting under:  R. N. Eaton & Company, Inc.

Our coating from Eaton is:  #9183 Asphalt Pipe Coating

Our FBE coating has an NSF 61 listing under:  Akzo Nobel Coatings, Inc; Rea=
ding, PA facility.

Our coating is INTERPON(r) AJ103QF 10-5110 100 BLUE[2]

A customer would confirm this by going to the NSF listing search website an=
d entering the company name.  On the web page that deals with NSF 61 listin=
gs and the specific plant (if there is more than one for that manufacturer)=
, they would see the products "listed" indicating compliance with NSF 61.  =
NSF 61 is a toxicity standard for potable water that some/many water author=
ities invoke.

J


--_000_4414AEBBCFB2B648B49E5766D309768E9B85E8DFF4MAIL_
